@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

title ServiceAccess lifecycle

[*] --> WAITING : created
WAITING --> CALLED : call
WAITING --> SUSPENDED : suspend
SUSPENDED --> WAITING : restore
SUSPENDED --> CALLED : call specific
CALLED --> WAITING : cancel call
CALLED --> ADMITTED : admit
ADMITTED --> CALLED : recall

note right of ADMITTED
  No terminal completed state is
  introduced in the current slice.
end note
@enduml
